# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types: feat | fix | docs | test | refactor | ci | chore | revert
# Scope: module | layer | area  (e.g. daemon, subgraphs, dashboard, ci)
# Subject: imperative, lowercase, <=150 chars, no trailing period
#
# Body (optional — explain WHY, not what):
#
#
# Footer:
# Closes #ISSUE
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Conventional Commits: https://www.conventionalcommits.org/
# Checked by .githooks/commit-msg and the CI "Lint PR title" step.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
